@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_CSRF
@session = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_COOKIE
@workspace = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_UUID

### Read the built-in DuckDuckGo preset, operator-owned providers and current version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/search-providers
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### DuckDuckGo is already available with id "duckduckgo" and preset:true.
### Select it directly below; it has no creation, edit or removal step.

### DeepSeek; use the latest version from GET (change type to exa for Exa)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/search-providers
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "DeepSeek search",
  "type": "deepseek",
  "apiKey": "REPLACE_WITH_API_KEY"
}

### Read the chat model's current revision and selection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/models
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### Select the DuckDuckGo preset together with the chat model
### Use the current revision and full model selection from GET above.
### Set searchProviderId to null to disable; omitting it preserves the saved choice.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/models
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 0,
  "selection": {
    "providerId": "REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_PROVIDER_UUID",
    "model": "REPLACE_WITH_MODEL_ID"
  },
  "searchProviderId": "duckduckgo"
}

### For a paid provider, replace "duckduckgo" above with its UUID from the catalog.

### Remove a provider after all workspace chat models stop using it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/search-providers/REPLACE_WITH_SEARCH_PROVIDER_UUID
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 2
}
